---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { photos } from "../lib/homepage";
import { serviceLinks } from "../lib/site";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import ActionPair from "./ActionPair.astro";
---
<section class="implant-section section-space" id="implants" aria-labelledby="implant-title" data-section="implants">
  <div class="shell split-layout"><div class="feature-photo"><Image src={photos.clinical} alt="Personal attention during a dental appointment at the practice" widths={[650, 1000, 1400]} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 48vw, 100vw" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="implant-title">Let’s Talk About<br /><strong>Dental Implants.</strong></h2><p>If missing teeth are affecting how you eat or smile, we can help you explore your options. Dental implants and restorative care can be part of a plan shaped around your needs.</p><p>Start with a conversation about your concerns, your goals, and what the next step could look like.</p><a class="text-link" href={serviceLinks.implants}>Explore Dental Implants <Icon /></a></div></div>
  <div class="shell"><div class="second-opinion"><div><h3>We’re Here To Talk Through<br /><strong>Your Implant Options.</strong></h3><p>Considering treatment or looking for another perspective? Contact our team to arrange a consultation.</p></div><ActionPair /></div></div>
</section>
